    /// Given two equal‐length binary strings `a` and `b` represented as `Vec<char>`,
    /// computes their bitwise XOR, returning a new `Vec<char>` of the same length.
    ///
    /// Precondition: `a.len() == b.len()`.  Every character of `a` and `b` is either
